   "title": "So This Happened (EP 442): Seyi Tinubu gives woman cash after declaring support for his father",
   "url": "https://punchng.com/so-this-happened-ep-442-seyi-tinubu-gives-woman-cash-after-declaring-support-for-his-father/",
