   "title": "Makinde’s campaign group demands probe of Tinubu’s N11.2trn crude oil-backed loans",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/top-news/924782-makindes-campaign-group-demands-probe-of-tinubus-n11-2trn-crude-oil-backed-loans.html",
