   "title": "2 French Guards Collapse During Macron’s Welcome Ceremony",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/2-french-guards-collapse-during-macrons-welcome-ceremony/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:14:49 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794514489.0,
   "ageDays": 0.04,
   "summary": "The incident occurred late Wednesday as French President Emmanuel Macron received his Slovak counterpart during an official visit. According to French newspaper, Le Parisien, Macron appeared concerned before proceeding to welcome Pellegrini. A French presidential source, who requested anonymity, told the Agence France-Presse (AFP) that both guards had suffered fainting attacks.",
   "summary_zh": "事件发生于周三晚，当时法国总统埃马纽埃尔·马克龙正在接待到法国进行正式访问的斯洛伐克总统。法国《巴黎人报》称，马克龙在上前迎接佩莱格里尼前显得忧心忡忡。一名要求匿名的法国总统府消息人士告诉法新社（AFP），两名警卫均曾昏厥。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The incident occurred late Wednesday as French President Emmanuel Macron received his Slovak counterpart during an official visit. Television footage showed one of the guards swaying before falling against a pillar at the presidential palace, causing his ceremonial sword to clatter to the ground. Macron and several aides immediately rushed towards the fallen guard, while another member of the ceremonial unit reportedly collapsed off camera. According to French newspaper, Le Parisien, Macron appeared concerned before proceeding to welcome Pellegrini. A French presidential source, who requested anonymity, told the Agence France-Presse (AFP) that both guards had suffered fainting attacks. “Both of them were swiftly taken care of and everything is fine,” the source said, adding that no further comment would be made. The Republican Guard, a unit of the French Gendarmerie, is responsible for ceremonial duties and honour guards during official state functions. Its duties often require members to stand for extended periods in heavy ceremonial uniforms while holding their swords vertically during formal receptions. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
