   "title": "N. Korea warns of action against US-led naval buildup",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/northkorea/20261112/n-korea-warns-of-action-against-us-led-naval-buildup",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
